From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:59:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 099/111] The preview selection stands out on code blocks and
 in light themes

The fill was a fixed 30% of the selection colour, faint on the darker
surface of code blocks and on light themes. Its strength is now worked
out from what it is drawn on: stronger until it stands out clearly from
the page or code block, and never so strong that the text on it stops
being readable.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

